        "name": "Content",
        "score": 9,
        "rationale": "It tells agents to query statusCheckRollup after any watch and covers both check-run `.conclusion` and legacy `.state`; it also says to report the parsed result rather than the watch's exit code or tail, and adds a pending-check caveat, though the pending check is stated rather than built into the query."
